questions.scenario:
You are debugging a production issue where a Spring Boot application experiences intermittent `ConcurrentModificationException` exceptions under high load. A developer implemented a custom session cache inside a Spring service:

java
@Service
public class UserSessionCache {
    private final Map<String, Session> cache = Collections.synchronizedMap(
        new LinkedHashMap<String, Session>(16, 0.75f, true) {
            @Override
            protected boolean removeEldestEntry(Map.Entry<String, Session> eldest) {
                return size() > 10_000;
            }
        }
    );

    public Session getSession(String id) {
        return cache.get(id);
    }

    public List<Session> getAllSessions() {
        return new ArrayList<>(cache.values());
    }
}
